	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">In praesentiarum quod scribam, non habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pectamus, quid <placeName ref="l339">Neocomensis</placeName>, qui nunc habetur, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ferat conventus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Amplissimam nostri miser<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>unt legationem; audimus etiam multorum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>principum et civitatum legatos illuc venturos.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Quid futurum sit, novit dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego parum boni s<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pero; sive enim bellum simus habituri, quid <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>bellum ferat, non ignoras, praesertim ut populus noster <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>erga eiusmodi bellum est affectus, sive pacem, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vix habebimus talem, quae non cum detrimento <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>gloriae dei et interitu multarum ecclesiarum sit coniuncta.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Mallem ergo honestum bellum, si mihi decernere <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>liceat, quam iniquam pacem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Non deesset dominus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>pro gloria sua aliquid audentibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Cives sane <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>bene sunt animati; sed metuo potentiores, qui, postquam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>res suas egerunt, possent facile nunc quasvis pacis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>recipere conditiones, modo cutis illis incolumis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et salva maneret substantia.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dominum oro, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ut is servet ecclesias suas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Monemus publice <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et privatim, et bona nobis fit spes; sed metuo <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>carnis artes; quaerit illa pacem cum mundo; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>pacem vero, quę cum deo est, non curat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fallar!</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Audimus quidem ducem nihil remittere <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>de suę postulationis rigore, atque utinam id esset!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Non enim aliter video nostros ad defensionem illius <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>terrae protrahi posse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Urget etiam transactionem; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>vult nimirum uti occasione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Vellet mox decidi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>rem omnem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sed certiora habebimus nostris reversis; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tum te de singulis quoque faciam certiorem.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Pro ultima tuorum in Ieremiam sermonum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>parte nuper per fratrem gratias egi, sed etiamnum ago <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et habeo maximas.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Memento vero, obsecro, eorum, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>quę de Daniele scripsi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Quę libertas fidelibus in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> concessa sit, ex <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>hoc mandato regis cognosces, quod hic mitto.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Cu<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>rabis tibi per aliquem transferri; <placeName ref="l822">Germanicum</placeName> enim <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>exemplar mihi nunc ad manus non est.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><placeName ref="l176">Glaronense</placeName> negotium nunc silet;</foreign> allein der badischen <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>cantzly ist man übel zuͦfriden mitt der h[eiligen] mäß.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Ich <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>acht, min herren habind den üweren drumb gschriben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Man ist gsinnet, es nitt ze lyden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Gott geb das hertz, das <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>es gschech!</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">All unser volk wäre den <placeName ref="l176">Gl[arneren]</placeName> ze <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>helffen 10 mal williger dann in <placeName ref="l2478">Saffoij</placeName> ze ziehen.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Sed haec propere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Commendo te domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Habeto me <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>quoque tibi commendatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta uxorem, filios, filias, <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>generos, omnes denique vestros.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>, socer, <persName ref="p8389">Hagius</persName>, <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <persName ref="p4791">Vischerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/>Reliqui sunt <placeName ref="l339">Neocomi</placeName>, <persName ref="p6801">Tilgerus</persName> scilicet, <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>, <persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z50"/><persName ref="p3873">Wingartnerus</persName> et <persName>Ambrosius imm <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>Hof</persName>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 12. februarii 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z52"/><persName ref="p8018">H[allerus]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo honorando et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>compatri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingeren</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
